<!--
  Sparkle 2 appcast TEMPLATE for Kitestring for Mac.

  This file only shows the shape of one entry. Real entries are generated by the appcast step of
  scripts/release_mac_app.sh: it signs the notarized DMG with the EdDSA private key file
  (exported with generate_keys -x and stored outside the repository), fills this template with
  the release's version, build, length and signature (sparkle:minimumSystemVersion becomes the
  App's MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET), and writes build/mac-app/site/appcast.xml: the new item first,
  then every item of the currently published appcast (supplied as a file or URL; an item
  with the same build number is replaced). The build number must be above every published one,
  or full mode refuses. Do not hand-edit signatures or lengths.

  Served at KITE_SPARKLE_FEED_URL (default https://lijunhua941-boop.github.io/kitestring-site/appcast.xml); the Mac App carries
  that URL as SUFeedURL and the matching public key as SUPublicEDKey (mac/App/Identity.xcconfig).
  See site/README.md, "Sparkle contract".
-->
